<title>USA: TABLE - Cleveland-Cliffs Inc Q2 shr falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Cleveland-Cliffs Inc Q2 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months    Six Months</p>
<p>					   Ended June 30   Ended June 30</p>
<p>					    1997    1996   1997   1996</p>
<p>REVENUES</p>
<p>		    Total Revenues     122.1  140.8  153.4  200.6</p>
<p>COSTS AND EXPENSES</p>
<p>	     Cost of goods sold and</p>
<p>		 operating expenses     96.1  106.2  117.1  152.9</p>
<p>	     Administrative, selling and</p>
<p>		 general expenses	  3.5    3.7    7.2    7.5</p>
<p>	     Interest expense	     .8    1.2    1.7    2.4</p>
<p>	     Other expenses		2.2    1.9    3.5    4.7</p>
<p>	   Total Costs and Expenses  102.6  113.0  129.5  167.5</p>
<p> INCOME BEFORE INCOME TAXES	   19.5   27.8   23.9   33.1</p>
<p> INCOME TAXES				6.6   10.0    8.0   11.7</p>
<p> NET INCOME				 12.9   17.8   15.9   21.4</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER COMMON SHARE	  1.14   1.52   1.40   1.82</p>
<p>		(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company attributed $6.4 million decrease in second quarter earnings before special items to termination of Savage River Mine operations in Australia, in March 1997, and higher North American mine operating costs.</p>
</text>
